<<<
touched upon. Don’t do it more than you can help, meaning not what it says but the opposite (than you cannot help), is worth changing into than you need or must or are obliged to, unless it is to rank as a STURDY INDEFENSIBLE. Better known than popular is cured by resolving better into more well.
===
touched upon. *Don't do it more than you* can *help,* meaning not what it says but the opposite (*than you can*not *help*), is worth changing into *than you need* or *must* or *are obliged to,* unless it is to rank as a ^^STURDY INDEFENSIBLE^^. *Better known than popular* is cured by resolving *better* into *more well.*
>>>

<<<
It is more or less— & certainly more than less—a standardized product is a case of Canni- BALISM, one of the necessary two mores having swallowed the other.
===
*It is more or less— & certainly more than less—a standardized product* is a case of ^^CANNIBALISM^^, one of the necessary two *mores* having swallowed the other.
>>>

<<<
Unwise striving after double emphasis accounts for He excelled as a lecturer more than as a preacher, because he felt freer to bring more of his personality into play, & for Were
===
Unwise striving after double emphasis accounts for *He excelled as a lecturer more than as a preacher, because he felt* freer to bring more of *his personality into play, & for Were*
>>>
